# Cloudflare Pages redirects. Static assets and Functions win over these, so a
# rule here only fires for a path nothing else serves.

# Subreddit Scout was retired. The URL was promoted from the homepage hero and
# listed in llms.txt, so it has inbound links and model-cached citations; those
# should land on the tools index rather than a 404.
/tools/subreddit-scout      /tools/   301
/tools/subreddit-scout/*    /tools/   301
